+The p. 23 reference to “(6.5)” is impossible—no such formula exists—and the
+data used are exactly (6.2).  **Repair: (6.5)→(6.2).**  The printed proof
+does 3a only.  For 3b, exchange the left and lower packages at
+\(\widetilde b\):
