+| Fig. 12 rows | \((\det D_a,x)\) | value from (5.A) |
+|---|---:|---:|
+| 1–5, 8, 9, 11, 12 | \((3,1)\) | \(-1\) |
+| 6, 7 | \((\det U,1)\) | \(-\frac13\det U\) |
+| 10 | \((3,\det U)\) | \(-\det U\) |
