+2. **Essential, (t=1,s>1):** (d_2=6-s,D_2=s,\mu_1=s-4\), and
+   \(\det\widetilde L_\infty=-s-2\).  Substitution in (7.12) gives
+   \[
+      s^2+s+5r-5>0.
+   \]
+   In the printed variable this is
+   (d_2^2-13d_2+37+5r); its discriminants for (r=2,3) are
