+3. **Essential, (s=1,t>1):** (d_2=6t-1,D_2=t,\mu_1=1-4t\), and
+   \(\det\widetilde L_\infty=-2t-1\).  Equation (7.12) has residual
+   \[
+      t^2+5t(r-1)+1>0.
+   \]
