+| 11 | \(\det\widetilde D_a^1=2,\det\widetilde D_a^2=1\), \(\det(\widetilde a\widetilde g_2)_\infty=\det U\) | \(\det\widetilde L_\infty=-2\det U\), and each upper \(\widetilde h\)-edge has determinant \(\det U\) |
