+  \(D_1\in\{\det\widetilde D_b^3,3\det\widetilde D_b^3\}\);
+- on \((\widetilde a\widetilde g_2)\), (2.6) similarly gives
+  \(D_1=\det\widetilde D_b^3-2\).
