+Set \(B=\det\operatorname{br}_{\widetilde b_2}
+(\widetilde a_1)_\infty\).  Formula (E) for
+\((\widetilde a_1\widetilde b_1)_\infty\) gives
+
+\[
+\begin{aligned}
+ 2d_2B
+ &=\lambda\{d_0d_2H-6d_0^2d_1d_2d_3\delta^2\}\\
+ &=2\lambda d_0d_2P,
+\end{aligned}
+\]
+
+so
+
+\[
+ B=\lambda d_0P.                                      \tag{7.4}
+\]
