+The companion calculation for
+\((\widetilde a_2\widetilde b_2)_\infty\) is
+
+\[
+ 2d_2\det\operatorname{br}_{\widetilde a_1}
+      (\widetilde b_2)_\infty
+ =\lambda d_2(H-6X)=2\lambda d_2P,
