+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| left branch at \(\widetilde a_1\) | \(d_0\) | \(d_4d_0\) | \(1\) |
+| crossed \((\widetilde a_1\widetilde b_2)\)-block | \(d_2\) | \(d_4d_2\) | \(d_4\) |
+| right branch at \(\widetilde b_2\) | \(1\) | \(d_4\) | \(1\) |
