+\[
+ \det\widetilde L_h={n(\widetilde h)\over4}\det L_h,
+ \quad\det(\widetilde a\widetilde h)
+ ={n(\widetilde h)\over4}\det(ah),
+ \quad\det(\widetilde h\widetilde g_2)
+ =n(\widetilde h)\det R_h,                              \tag{5.4}
+\]
+
+so (5.4) is **REPLAYED-SOUND**.
