+### 4.1 Fig. 14 parameters and integrality
+
+Keep the graph \(\delta(ab)\) distinct from its determinant
+\(\delta:=\det\delta(ab)\).  Put
+
+\[
+ X=d_0d_1d_3\delta^2,\qquad H=18X-2d_2,\qquad P=6X-d_2.
+\]
