+
+Let \(d=\det(\widetilde b\widetilde g_1)>0\), keeping it distinct from the
+canonical degrees.  The two final substitutions are
+
+\[
+\begin{array}{c|c}
+ \widetilde v\in(\widetilde b\widetilde a)&
+ 0=1-d+4(d+3)-2(d-1)=15+d \quad\text{from (2.12)},\\
