+\(\det\widetilde D_q=\det D_q>1\), using Proposition 1.3 only after the
+lower branch is fixed.  **Verdict: REPLAYED-SOUND.**
+
+Finally, applying the same endpoint indices to \(L_h,(ah),R_h\) gives
