+Its wording “the lower branch of degree 1 ... equals three” is true for 3a.
+For 3b it is the **left** degree-one branch.  The product in (6.A) is
+unchanged.  **Corollary 6.2: REPAIRED[LOWER→LEFT-IN-3b] | Both.**
+
