+    excluded from containing the root.
+
+DEPENDS[ROOT-DELTA-G2-APPLICATION]
+  = Lemma 3.15, pp. 14–15: the hypotheses needed to apply Lemmas 2.5–2.6
+    to every selected vertex of delta(a~,g~2) were not established.
+```
