+does 3a only.  For 3b, exchange the left and lower packages at
+\(\widetilde b\):
+
+\[
+ \det\widetilde L_b^1=3\det\widetilde L_b^3,
+ \qquad \det\widetilde D_b^2=\det\widetilde D_b^{2\prime},
